## 3. Medical Documents & File Storage
- **Decision**: File binaries are stored in the server directory configured by `UPLOAD_DIR` (`./data/uploads/`), with document metadata stored in MongoDB collection `medical_documents`.
- **Fields**:
  - `patient_id` (`PydanticObjectId`, indexed)
  - `family_member_id` (`Optional[PydanticObjectId]`)
  - `appointment_id` (`Optional[PydanticObjectId]`)
  - `name` (`str`)
  - `category` (`lab_report` | `prescription` | `imaging` | `discharge_summary` | `other`)
  - `mime` (`str`)
  - `size_bytes` (`int`)
  - `file_path` (`str`)
  - `uploaded_at` (`datetime`)
- **Validation**:
  - Allowed MIME types: `application/pdf`, `image/png`, `image/jpeg`, `image/webp`.
  - Max per-file upload size: 10 MB (`MAX_UPLOAD_MB`).
  - Max total quota per patient: 50 MB (`USER_QUOTA_MB`).

