## 4. Support Tickets
- **Decision**: Stored in collection `support_tickets`.
- **Fields**:
  - `reference` (`str`: unique human-friendly format `TCK-XXXXX`)
  - `patient_id` (`PydanticObjectId`, indexed)
  - `category` (`booking_problem` | `queue_or_waiting` | `fee_or_payment` | `app_problem` | `privacy_concern` | `other`)
  - `appointment_id` (`Optional[PydanticObjectId]`)
  - `hospital_id` (`Optional[PydanticObjectId]`)
  - `description` (`str`)
  - `contact_preference` (`Channel`: `in_app` | `email` | `sms`)
  - `status` (`open` | `in_review` | `resolved`)
  - `created_at` (`datetime`)
- **APIs**: `POST /support/tickets`, `GET /support/tickets`.

---

## 5. Patient Reviews & Aggregations
- **Decision**: Collection `reviews` supports rich rating breakdown, tags, and expected wait perception.
- **Fields**:
  - `appointment_id` (`PydanticObjectId`, unique index — strictly one review per completed appointment)
  - `patient_id` (`PydanticObjectId`)
  - `doctor_id` (`PydanticObjectId`, indexed)
  - `hospital_id` (`PydanticObjectId`, indexed)
  - `doctor_rating` (`int`: 1 to 5)
  - `hospital_rating` (`int`: 1 to 5)
  - `comment` (`Optional[str]`)
  - `tags` (`list[str]`)
  - `wait_as_expected` (`shorter` | `as_expected` | `longer`)
  - `created_at` (`datetime`)
  - `updated_at` (`datetime`)
- **Enforcement**:
  - Creation allowed only after `appointment.status == 'completed'`.
  - Edit allowed only within a 48-hour window (`created_at + 48 hours`).
  - Average ratings on `Doctor` (`rating_avg`, `rating_count`) and `Hospital` are incrementally updated on review submission.

